# Typography checkpoint (pre-guidelines)

## Live typography before Inter-only switch

**Status:** Guidelines typography (Inter Bold / Medium / Regular) is now active on the marketing site. This checkpoint remains the revert source.

**Git tag:** `type-live-pre-guidelines`  
**Commit:** `4ffc920` — *Adopt the official Colour Palette guideline tokens.* (palette already applied; type still pre-guidelines at this tag)

### Pre-guidelines system

| Role | Pre-guidelines (live) | Guidelines (target / now) |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Headers | Libre Baskerville Bold via `font-editorial` on Hero, Data Gap, Invisible Pipeline, Closing CTA; Inter Bold elsewhere | Inter Bold |
| Sub headers | Mostly Inter Semibold (`font-semibold` / 600) | Inter Medium (`font-medium` / 500) |
| Body | Inter Regular | Inter Regular |
| Logo | Supplied SVG/PNG artwork | Same — never live MuseoModerno |

### Key files at checkpoint

- `app/layout.tsx` — loads `Inter` + `Libre_Baskerville` (`--font-editorial`)
- `tailwind.config.ts` — `editorial` / `serif` → Libre Baskerville
- Homepage: `Hero.tsx`, `DataGap.tsx`, `InvisiblePipelineSection.tsx`, `ClosingCta.tsx` use `font-editorial`
- Side-by-side: `/type-compare` left column preserves the checkpoint look (loads Libre Baskerville only on that route)

### How to revert

```bash
git checkout type-live-pre-guidelines -- \
  app/layout.tsx \
  tailwind.config.ts \
  components/Hero.tsx \
  components/DataGap.tsx \
  components/InvisiblePipelineSection.tsx \
  components/ClosingCta.tsx \
  components/HowItWorksSection.tsx \
  components/ReportRevealsSection.tsx \
  components/AboutSection.tsx \
  components/EditorialStatCallout.tsx \
  components/NavBar.tsx
```

Restore other touched weight/class files from the same tag if needed. Do not delete `type-live-pre-guidelines` without asking the user.

**MuseoModerno:** wordmark development only — never a live UI font; always use supplied logo artwork.
